        <briefdescription>
<para>This function initializes the specified Poly1305 context. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>It must be the first API called before using the context.</para><para>It is usually followed by a call to <computeroutput><ref refid="poly1305_8h_1aeec95fe26f3ddb9e631d3a916449b6fb" kindref="member">mbedtls_poly1305_starts()</ref></computeroutput>, then one or more calls to <computeroutput><ref refid="poly1305_8h_1a42b517f2ebf7cfb16b69fb1ad77744c1" kindref="member">mbedtls_poly1305_update()</ref></computeroutput>, then one call to <computeroutput><ref refid="poly1305_8h_1aa35e33f2364e0f8bb74c5db91d06d79d" kindref="member">mbedtls_poly1305_finish()</ref></computeroutput>, then finally <computeroutput><ref refid="poly1305_8h_1afb89cdb66e1ddf8c84bf703285d54e56" kindref="member">mbedtls_poly1305_free()</ref></computeroutput>.</para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>ctx</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The Poly1305 context to initialize. This must not be <computeroutput>NULL</computeroutput>. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
