        <briefdescription>
<para>This function sets the one-time authentication key. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="warning"><para>The key must be unique and unpredictable for each invocation of Poly1305.</para></simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
